 would cuddle  and snuggle and also roughhouse and do  all sorts of other very physical things  with each other at that time he was a  strong runner and  you know good strong jaws as well so we  used to play quite a bit and you know  you can see in the background natural  environment that he really loved the  woods the fields parks things like that  here's another selfie that I took with  him as we roughhouse out in the yard in  Kingston New York Magnus also like to  sleep on top of me as you see I'm doing  here in our apartment and Kingston his  eyes are closed because he is actually  fast asleep  here he is hanging out with me as I am  reading in the apartment we go off and  cuddle up close he see his pillow there  he's quite awake but you know pretty  sedate there's a book that is reading as  we were hanging out together you see  sunlight streaming in and in the  background you can see one of the cats  there she is  hogging the sunlight as much as possible  Magnus was always prone to this sort of  cuddling our landlords in Kingston had a  large fenced-in yard with woods and  hills and all sorts of cool stuff  there's Magnus playing with their dog  Baxter who is his little buddy and I'll  just let you watch what are you doing  little buddy  you got something on your mind what is  it buddy  Magnus loved the snow his sister and  mica not quite so much as that she had  short hair and wasn't as good at getting  around in it we got a lot of snowfall in  Kingston and so I would trample paths  for them throughout the yard so they  could get around and play and enjoy  themselves  can I let's go  [Music]  [Music]  come on Mika  come on big girl come on Maggie  [Music]  come on pika  good girl okay come on you guys let's go  get a mica  [Music]  back when they were middle-aged and  strong Magnus and Amica really enjoyed  playing tug of war with each other as  you can see and Magnus was stronger at  the time of ameica  Oh  [Music]  [Music]  kidding me  [Music]  they often pl